#. comic116 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#title.1"
msgid "\"THE WALL\""
msgstr "«СТЕНА»"

#. comic116 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: bogeytable3.gif
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:73
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#p1.1"
msgid "Welcome to Fourth Wall Week!"
msgstr "Добро пожаловать на Неделю четвёртой стены!"

#. comic116 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bogeytable3.gif
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#p1.2"
msgid "Since Radd so rudely shattered the fourth wall last week, we've decided to keep it broken for now, and just have some fun this week."
msgstr "Раз уж Улёт на прошлой неделе так грубо разрушил четвёртую стену, мы решили пока её не чинить и просто повеселиться."

#. comic116 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:137
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#p2.1"
msgid "Fourth what?"
msgstr "Четвёртой чего?"

#. comic116 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:141
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#p2.2"
msgid "\"Fourth wall.\" It means we're breaking the rules of storytelling, and we're aware of the readers at home."
msgstr "«Четвёртой стены». Это значит, мы нарушаем правила повествования и знаем о читателях по ту сторону экрана."

#. comic116 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:190
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#p3.1"
msgid "I don't get it."
msgstr "Не понимаю."

#. comic116 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:194
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#p3.2"
msgid "There's nothing to \"get.\" Just say something to the folks out there."
msgstr "Тут нечего «понимать». Просто скажи что-нибудь людям по ту сторону."

#. comic116 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwink.gif, bogeysigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:245
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#p4.1"
msgid "Hey everybody! Can someone lend me a twenty?"
msgstr "Привет всем! Кто-нибудь одолжит двадцатку?"

#. comic116 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwink.gif, bogeysigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic116.htm:249
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic116#p4.2"
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr "Проехали."

#. comic117 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#title.1"
msgid "\"LOVE IS BLIND\""
msgstr "«ЛЮБОВЬ СЛЕПА»"

#. comic117 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddstare.gif
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:73
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#p1.1"
msgid "Fourth Wall Week continues!"
msgstr "Неделя четвёртой стены продолжается!"

#. comic117 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddstare.gif
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#p1.2"
msgid "During this week's event, I'd like to take the opportunity to talk about my relationship with Sheena."
msgstr "Пользуясь случаем, я хотел бы поговорить о своих отношениях с Шиной."

#. comic117 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtable3.gif
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:136
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#p2.1"
msgid "Am I a lucky S.O.B. or what? It's painfully obvious that I'm destined to end up with that chick."
msgstr "Ну не везучий ли я сукин сын? До боли очевидно, что мне суждено быть с этой девчонкой."

#. comic117 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddrock.gif, sheenamad2.gif, bg3.gif
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:188
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#p3.1"
msgid "First off, we seem to hate other. All you anime fans know what that old cliche means."
msgstr "Во-первых, мы вроде как ненавидим друг друга. Все анимешники знают, что означает это старое клише."

#. comic117 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtable.gif, shead.gif
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:238
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#p4.1"
msgid "Plus, she's the only eligible female in the strip, and I'm the lead male character. Who else would I go with?"
msgstr "К тому же она единственная свободная девушка в комиксе, а я — главный герой. С кем ещё мне быть?"

#. comic117 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rheadjoy.gif
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:292
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#p5.1"
msgid "Face it, it's only a matter of time before I'm on the receiving end of muchas smoochas. Heh heh!"
msgstr "Признайте, это лишь вопрос времени — скоро меня ждут чмоки-чмоки. Хе-хе!"

#. comic117 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstare.gif, bogeyhug.gif
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:343
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#p6.1"
msgid "Unless, of course, the writer of this strip is more warped than I'd thought."
msgstr "Если только автор этого комикса не ещё более чокнутый, чем я думал."

#. comic117 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstare.gif, bogeyhug.gif
#: kidradd/comic117.htm:347
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic117#p6.2"
msgid "You're sooooo cute!"
msgstr "Ты тако-о-ой милашка!"

#. comic118 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#title.1"
msgid "\"CENTERFOLD\""
msgstr "«РАЗВОРОТ»"

#. comic118 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddblink.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:73
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p1.1"
msgid "More Fourth Wall Week hilarity!"
msgstr "Неделя четвёртой стены — веселье продолжается!"

#. comic118 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddblink.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:79
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p1.2"
msgid "And now, as a publicity stunt, here's something you've all been dying to see!"
msgstr "А теперь, ради рекламы, — то, что вы все до смерти хотели увидеть!"

#. comic118 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddblink.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p1.3"
msgid "\"All?\""
msgstr "«Все»?"

#. comic118 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddrock.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:137
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p2.1"
msgid "Well, three or four of you anyway. I now proudly present - -"
msgstr "Ну, трое-четверо из вас точно. С гордостью представляю - -"

#. comic118 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddrock.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:139
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p2.2"
msgid "Oh brother."
msgstr "О боже."

#. comic118 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenaswim.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:192
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p3.1"
msgid "- - Sheena in swimwear!"
msgstr "- - Шину в купальнике!"

#. comic118 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaswim.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:194
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p3.2"
msgid "This is stupid."
msgstr "Глупость какая."

#. comic118 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwink.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:244
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p4.1"
msgid "But don't worry ladies, we didn't forget about you. Prepare yourself for a peek at the hottest male bod in the strip..."
msgstr "Но не волнуйтесь, дамы, о вас мы не забыли. Приготовьтесь взглянуть на самое горячее мужское тело в комиксе..."

#. comic118 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bogeyswim.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:297
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p5.1"
msgid "...Bogey in a speedo!"
msgstr "...Бяка в плавках!"

#. comic118 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeyswim.gif, floor2.gif
#: kidradd/comic118.htm:299
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic118#p5.2"
msgid "This is almost as embarassing as it is painful."
msgstr "Это почти так же унизительно, как и больно."

#. comic119 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic119.htm:55
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic119#title.1"
msgid "\"SAMURAI\""
msgstr "«САМУРАЙ»"

#. comic119 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenastare.gif
#: kidradd/comic119.htm:98
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic119#p1.1"
msgid "Since our game was destroyed, we at Kid Radd have not provided many exciting action sequences lately. But we can remedy that."
msgstr "С тех пор как нашу игру уничтожили, мы в «Улёт-парне» не баловали вас захватывающим экшеном. Но это можно исправить."

#. comic119 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif
#: kidradd/comic119.htm:155
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic119#p2.1"
msgid "To supply you with some purely gratuitous violence, Radd and Bogey shall now have a Kurosawa-style sword duel. Enjoy!"
msgstr "Чтобы обеспечить вас совершенно беспричинным насилием, Улёт и Бяка сейчас сразятся на мечах в стиле Куросавы. Наслаждайтесь!"

#. comic119 panel p3
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic119.htm:217
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic119#p3.1"
msgid "Pseudo-widescreen makes anything cool."
msgstr "Псевдоширокий экран делает крутым что угодно."

#. comic119 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: duelend.gif
#: kidradd/comic119.htm:261
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic119#p4.1"
msgid "Next time, maybe we'll train them first."
msgstr "В следующий раз, может, сначала их потренируем."

#. comic119 panel p4
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: duelend.gif
#: kidradd/comic119.htm:270
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic119#p4.2"
msgid "Where's my other leg?"
msgstr "Где моя вторая нога?"

#. comic119 panel p4
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: duelend.gif
#: kidradd/comic119.htm:270
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic119#p4.3"
msgid "A ass is you."
msgstr "Ты есть задница."

